<title>INDIA: RTRS-Hockey - Australia draw with Holland 1-1 in Champions Trophy.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hockey - Australia draw with Holland 1-1 in Champions Trophy.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the round-robin league of the Champions Trophy hockey tournament on Friday: Holland drew with Australia 1-1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Holland - Derk Buma Jaap 10</p>
<p>Australia - Baeden Choppy 61.</p>
